#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Gate 25 A7: the figure/text reconciliation table.

Every row was established by comparing a rendered figure against the manuscript
text and against the results file the figure is built from. Kept as a script
rather than a hand-written CSV so out/results/ has no orphan and the table can be
regenerated.
"""
